{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1000_p", "source_sha256": "b1d3e6af488b4c07f8f719f74e768ef58858d888c95d26f4c173349c930d7cea", "ja": "（今日は真美は、これまでにない撮影の仕事だ。\nプリントシール機の筐体に使われる画像らしいが……）", "zh": "（今天是真美接到前所未有的拍摄工作。听说要把照片用在大头贴机的机身上……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1001_012mam", "source_sha256": "a629dfb22c00e8602713822098102a2cabbee47d54505cd6a39c5fd972cd4cae", "ja": "あ……お仕事お疲れさま、\n{$P$}さん♪", "zh": "啊……工作辛苦了，\n{$P$}先生♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1002_p", "source_sha256": "63ce3c9f14de6e02c8beff5d144221baf8110498bab40e148ffb1ee009b826e2", "ja": "（ぷ、プロ……？）\nえっと、遅れてごめんな。撮影の方は順調か？", "zh": "（制、制作人……？）\n呃，抱歉来晚了。拍摄进行得顺利吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1003_012mam", "source_sha256": "86c8639b95b3f93c97ba03185f1b3f0993950853c4693800916bd6a0a9e8940e", "ja": "うん。とってもいい感じで撮影できてるよ。\nスタッフの人たちも優しいし。", "zh": "嗯。拍摄进展得非常顺利哦。\n工作人员们人也很好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1004_p", "source_sha256": "a6404b3fde1937dd49c3fc8b564d6600773c1e96621ff25ed40f39578bffad11", "ja": "そうか……。でもどうしたんだ？　様子がおかしい\nけど……、何かトラブルでもあったのか？", "zh": "这样啊……不过，怎么了？你的样子有点奇怪。难道是遇到什么麻烦了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1005_012mam", "source_sha256": "1b8abe181218a543e1c01fe2ce99deffe899aed987bc3d96d273a078f579429a", "ja": "何にもないよ。ただ、今日の撮影はガーリック\nだから、少しだけ胸がドキドキしてるかも……☆", "zh": "没什么啦。只是，今天的拍摄主题是大蒜，所以心里可能有点怦怦直跳……☆", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1006_p", "source_sha256": "ba6e1e795a3696d1c114e44cf931ecf49844b867430d88678ecad4676fca0f9c", "ja": "にんにく……それを言うならガーリッシュだな。\nいや、そんなことはどうでもいい。", "zh": "大蒜……要这么说的话，应该是少女风才对吧。算了，这不重要。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1007_p", "source_sha256": "0233b778f64a6be6bee990bf9646d0ac748415d0d43eb2efa62303885b1cefce", "ja": "ドキドキってことは……動悸？\nまさか体調が悪いのか？　大丈夫か？", "zh": "心跳得扑通扑通的……是心悸吗？\n难道身体不舒服？没事吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1008_012mam", "source_sha256": "8d3aab7857f1b32c18c4a720c6147772cc7f208218e01619cb646231f56d7e2a", "ja": "も～、{$P$}さん、心配しすぎ！\nいつまでも子供扱いしないで。うふふ♪", "zh": "真是的～，{$P$}先生你太爱操心了！\n别总把我当小孩子看嘛。呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1009_p", "source_sha256": "66f180f9d36d2cf9c71ed37378df7ffb4608d2fbf2a37ce69aae176cedb2f860", "ja": "トラブルでも病気でもないってことは……、\nさては、また俺を罠にはめようとしてるな！？", "zh": "既不是遇到麻烦，也不是生病，也就是说……你又想给我下套吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1010_012mam", "source_sha256": "417f96a6594f3a37b1250d0b2429044d84c15ab50ba3891931f3a8fb403f250e", "ja": "ちょっと兄ちゃん！　真美のこと\nドッキリの仕掛人だとか思ってない！？", "zh": "喂，哥哥！你该不会以为真美是整蛊的幕后主使吧！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1011_012mam", "source_sha256": "29397cf7afa6440d09dbeef9610b4a885dce894c0b857bd7e45c164850bdca13", "ja": "真美だって、みんなと同じアイドルちゃん\nなんだかんね！　ぷんぷかプンプン！", "zh": "真美也是和大家一样的偶像嘛！  \n气鼓鼓地生气啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1012_p", "source_sha256": "882ad0b7c93e5c202f91cf0322014dcde17f79a68888813eb9f4486cbcc1538b", "ja": "いや、それはわかってるんだが……。\nというか、いつもの真美に戻ってるな。", "zh": "不，我知道是那样没错……  \n话说回来，你已经变回平时的真美了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1013_012mam", "source_sha256": "73155205b3406c2508a46fa398edfcb4c01297da054f2c5e222334f0572c9ebf", "ja": "え？　……ああああぁ！！　戻っちゃってた！！\nせっかくいい感じに変身できてたのにー！！", "zh": "诶？……啊啊啊啊！！不知不觉又变回来了！！\n好不容易才成功变身的——！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1014_p", "source_sha256": "6430c913af529fc6d8dffb3ec7c3718f09895c998fa3e1abf71f91e5dc5add22", "ja": "変身……？　どういうことだ……？", "zh": "变身……？　这是怎么回事……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1015_012mam", "source_sha256": "e772d53f09bbca99fa5feab8e952d24e571f7cc6fd63c82a26c9e0df0daad7bd", "ja": "むぅー、だってぇー。今日の撮影、思ってた以上に\nゆめふわでキラキラなフンイキだったんだもん。", "zh": "唔——可是……今天的拍摄，比想象中\n还要梦幻软萌、亮晶晶的感觉嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1016_012mam", "source_sha256": "9670f2fbba35c819247605393b7b763fc9c9928548275c661fdb45113b5e99b8", "ja": "だから、あんまりアゲアゲだと変かなって思って、\nキャラ変えてたのに……。うー、兄ちゃんのせいだ！", "zh": "所以，我想着要是太嗨了会不会有点奇怪，明明都在努力改变形象了……呜——都怪哥哥！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1017_p", "source_sha256": "256e44156fa27510615b7dc24e390e6870196ef95a965cb6cd433025ccde1877", "ja": "なるほど、そういうことだったのか。\n……でも、無理して変身しなくていいんじゃないかな。", "zh": "原来是这么回事啊。\n……不过，也不用勉强自己改变吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c47d97d4cdee3890146de955b06d9f5acab3e850d64719158ca5ee71b623162c", "ja": "すました真美もかわいかったけど、いつもの、\nいまの真美の方が、もっとキラキラしてると思うぞ。", "zh": "装作成熟的真美也很可爱，不过我觉得，还是平时的、现在的真美更加闪耀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1019_012mam", "source_sha256": "3d1410fa3f37171117ff06f6d28eb05d6a3d42cf40174482d80259d7045bc1ce", "ja": "え？　いまの真美の方がまぶしいの？\n全米が立ちくらみ？", "zh": "咦？现在的真美更耀眼吗？\n全美都站起来头晕了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1020_p", "source_sha256": "88dd322d1c8669a1a7263e69452e9300bf18095b756f5e5f28aa6efdc5781da7", "ja": "全米のことは知らないけど、\nまあ、そういうことだ！", "zh": "全美利坚的事我不知道，不过，大概就是这么回事！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1021_012mam", "source_sha256": "e491d0c879fff74e1b6abf92981318d5e4cd27c62aeaf14c97ab31f78ef7a744", "ja": "そっかぁ～。えへへっ、わかった♪\n兄ちゃんがそういうなら、真美もそれで！", "zh": "这样啊～。嘿嘿，我明白啦♪\n既然哥哥都这么说了，真美也就这样！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1022_012mam", "source_sha256": "19503727cefb89d8c22c53949fc4eeca6c6710db7388e8ad9dd4a6e48d5e23be", "ja": "んじゃ、この後の撮影はテンションアゲアゲ、\nガリガリガーリーで行くねっ！　見ててね、兄ちゃん♪", "zh": "那接下来的拍摄，我就兴致高涨地、元气满满地上啦！看好了，哥哥♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1023_p", "source_sha256": "daaa2c112c845fc8da9bb4752fd1f05a47c9d41104012eed5e57d84148b46996", "ja": "ああ、ちゃんと見てるから。頑張れよ！", "zh": "嗯，我会好好看着的。加油啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_012mam0164_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_012mam0164_1024_p", "source_sha256": "fc9e6639ed9008857a793adf73f4e962df1b8833bc3b8faf910791df4ba92779", "ja": "（有言実行。その後の撮影で真美は、素直で飾らない\nゆめカワ笑顔を存分に振りまいてくれた！）", "zh": "（说到做到。之后的拍摄中，真美尽情展现了率真不做作的梦幻可爱笑容！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
